{"id":"A2-L090","title":"Infinitive of purpose: practice and contrast","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U06","focus":"Infinitive of purpose — prática e contraste","targets":{"grammar":"Infinitive of purpose — prática e contraste","pron":"Plural e 3ª pessoa /s/ /z/ /ɪz/","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["secret","mystery","old box","family letter","grandma’s kitchen","market trip","fresh flowers","attic trunk","brass key","key ring","family secret","dusty trunk","wooden box","letter seal","memory box","old photo"],"field":"Planos","genre":"Conto e trecho de peça","skill":"Escrita","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 90 · Infinitive of purpose: practice and contrast","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Infinitive of purpose — prática e contraste.","**Pronúncia:** Plural e 3ª pessoa /s/ /z/ /ɪz/.","**10 palavras novas** (planos).","**Texto do dia:** conto e trecho de peça."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo contrastar to + verbo, for + -ing e for + substantivo, num conto."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **escrever frases claras e corretas (IELTS Writing, TOEFL Writing)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["secret","segredo"],["mystery","mistério"],["old box","old box"],["family letter","family letter"],["grandma’s kitchen","grandma’s kitchen"],["market trip","market trip"],["fresh flowers","fresh flowers"],["attic trunk","attic trunk"],["brass key","brass key"],["key ring","key ring"],["family secret","family secret"],["dusty trunk","dusty trunk"],["wooden box","wooden box"],["letter seal","letter seal"],["memory box","memory box"],["old photo","old photo"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A short story","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"The Old Key","paras":["Nina found a key. “What is it **for**?” she asked. Her grandmother said, “It’s **for opening** the old box.” Nina used it **to open** the box **to find** a letter. She went to the kitchen **to show** it to her mother, and they went to the market **for** some flowers."],"kicker":"SHORT STORY","by":"A reader","gloss":[["key","chave"],["box","caixa"],["letter","carta"],["flower","flor"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The key is for opening a box.","ans":"T","why":"for opening."},{"q":"Nina used the key to cook.","ans":"F","why":"to open the box."},{"q":"They went to the market for flowers.","ans":"T","why":"for some flowers."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“letter” = ?","opts":["carta","letra","leite"],"ans":0,"why":"letter."},{"q":"“flower” = ?","opts":["flor","farinha","fumaça"],"ans":0,"why":"flower."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"to / for","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Estrutura","Exemplo"],"rows":[["to + verbo (propósito)","**I used it to open the box.**"],["for + -ing (função de um objeto)","**It’s for opening boxes.**"],["for + substantivo","**We went to the market for flowers.**"]],"cap":"to / for"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Com pessoas: *for me/you* (benefício). Cuidado: ✗ *I went there for study* → ✓ *to study*."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I used the key ___ open the box. (to)","a":"to","why":"propósito."},{"s":"It’s ___ opening boxes. (for)","a":"for","why":"função."},{"s":"We went to the market ___ flowers. (for)","a":"for","why":"substantivo."},{"s":"She went home ___ rest. (to)","a":"to","why":"propósito."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["key","chave"],["box","caixa"],["letter","carta"],["flower","flor"],["attic","sótão"]]},{"ty